Variable u
Variable v
Variable w

Metavariable P:Statement
Metavariable Q:Statement

Rule (UniqueExistentialIntroduction)
  Premises
    v is missing in P
    [P[v for u]] ... v = u
    ∃u P
  Conclusion
    ∃!u P

Rule (UniqueExistentialElimination)
  Premises
    u is undefined 
    v is missing in P
    ∃!u P
    [P[v for u]] ... Q
    u is 𝘧𝘳𝘦𝘦 in P
  Conclusion
    Q

Rule (UniqueExistentialUniqueness)
  Premises
    ∃!u P
    P[v for u]
    P[w for u]
  Conclusion
    v = w
